---
name: plan-scope-reviewer-assignment
version: 1.1.2
description: Render a fenced-JSON assignment for plan-scope-reviewer over a plan in beads. `plan_docs` are the files quality-mgr writes by piping `bd show <sprint container> --json` for every sprint container under the root; `phase_root_doc` is the same for the root. On plan QA-1, review the plan's shape in full; when `carry_forward_findings_json` has ids, verify only the reviewer's carried finding ids against their original acceptance criteria and do not recompute plan shape or file new findings. A round after the first refuses to render without them.
format: json
required_variables:
  - root
  - phase_root_doc
  - plan_docs
  - reference_docs
  - worktree_path
  - branch
  - commit
optional_variables:
  - phase
  - round_index
  - carry_forward_findings_json
  - notes
defaults:
  phase: ""
  round_index: 1
  carry_forward_findings_json: "[]"
  notes: ""
---
{#- A plan round after the first is fix verification: this reviewer re-checks only its own carried ids; without them the render fails instead of running open-ended. #}
{%- set cf = carry_forward_findings_json | replace(" ", "") -%}
{%- set locked = cf not in ["", "[]", "null", "[null]", "[\"\"]"] -%}
{%- if round_index | int > 1 and not locked %}FIX_ROUND_SCOPE_LOCK_REQUIRED{% endif -%}
{
  "scope": {
    "phase": {% if phase %}{{ phase }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
    "sprint": null
  },
  "plan": "beads",
  "root": {{ root }},
  "phase_root_doc": {{ phase_root_doc }},
  "plan_docs": [{% for doc in plan_docs %}{{ doc }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}],
  "reference_docs": [{% for doc in reference_docs %}{{ doc }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}],
  "worktree_path": {{ worktree_path }},
  "branch": {{ branch }},
  "commit": {{ commit }},
  "round_index": {{ round_index }},
  "carry_forward_findings": {{ carry_forward_findings_json | safe }},
  "findings_scope_locked": {% if locked %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
  "notes": {{ notes }}
}
